# Edit groups: instructions the build translates twice, as the game has them and as each target's edits.map
# changes them (GROUP ADDRESS OLDHEX NEWHEX); a mod switches a group on with rc_edit_enable before the game runs
# (runtime/rc_mid.h). The generated code and the runtime number the groups by their place here.
# --- Seven-String Guitar (a mod's: rearmed-mods, after rs7string): begin
seven_string  # Seven-String Guitar: the native layouts
plain_packages  # Plain Packages: unencrypted song archives
# --- Seven-String Guitar: end
